        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Arenal Volcano and the hot springs of La Fortuna"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:highlight_text:15214eae906a9af7",
      "field": "highlight.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "af4bf947bf23da609e3873c5047efcbffebafb683589a02b92c7c41dab80fc92",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-bde0f3741f24400e07188c41",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "La Fortuna lies near Arenal Volcano. The area is known for its tropical forest, lake, waterfalls and hot springs. You'll spend several days here, with a trip to Caño Negro, a chocolate tour, a walk on the volcano's slopes, hanging bridges and outdoor activities above the rainforest."
    },
